    <p>This is a short, plain-language version of what happens with your information when you contact Third Mind Learning.</p>
    <p>Right now, the only way to reach me is email. If you email me, I have whatever you send — typically your name, email address, and whatever you wrote. If you ask to be added to the mailing list, I keep your email address for that purpose only.</p>
    <p>I don't sell or share your information with anyone. I don't use it for anything other than responding to you or, if you've asked for it, sending occasional updates. You can ask to be removed from the mailing list at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:joe@thirdmindlearning.com">joe@thirdmindlearning.com</a>.</p>
    <p>This site doesn't run analytics or advertising trackers.</p>
    <p>If this policy changes as the site grows — for example, if a signup form or a new tool is added — this page will be updated to reflect it.</p>
